      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-04",
        "episodeNumber": 1,
        "name": "Episode 1",
        "overview": "Noura and Rakan land in Riyadh with baggage no airline can carry: a divorce, a rejection and families awaiting answers. Their quickest escape route? Fake a marriage and hope the lie has a smooth landing.",
        "stillPath": "/loMCG8zmz7FdGwDwasUr26xfIgf.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-04",
        "episodeNumber": 2,
        "name": "Episode 2",
        "overview": "Noura and Rakan’s marriage story fails its first table test when their lies refuse to match. Just as they score points with his family, hers turns Rakan’s world upside down—quite literally.",
        "stillPath": "/uUHExDsd3ZRqcloCRRsQ4ukYIy2.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-04",
        "episodeNumber": 3,
        "name": "Episode 3",
        "overview": "Falah may deny Noura is his daughter, but he has no trouble claiming her son. As old wounds reopen, Salem becomes the ace up his grandfather’s sleeve in a family battle where blood is both a bond and a weapon.",
        "stillPath": "/cHUvOex1fQGpx0ocVfApMS3RjdO.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-04",
        "episodeNumber": 4,
        "name": "Episode 4",
        "overview": "Fake vows, real sparks, and now a proposal no one rehearsed. But Falah does not give daughters away for free: if Rakan wants Noura, another wedding must seal the deal.",
        "stillPath": "/a091gDvsi1ESmKxsQViqhvaZG2R.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-04",
        "episodeNumber": 5,
        "name": "Episode 5",
        "overview": "What Falah wants, Falah gets—taking arranged marriage far too literally. When his chosen match goes off the grid, Noura and Rakan play detective, following the trail to a farm ripe with answers.",
        "stillPath": "/m5oaeOxJ1WTLvmzCOrBgxQ5ktfr.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-05",
        "episodeNumber": 6,
        "name": "Episode 6",
        "overview": "POV: Salma is missing, Noura and Rakan are lost, and the family scandal has found its audience! Meanwhile, Salma’s alleged “kidnapper” is somehow earning points, and Nawal decides Falah doesn’t get to have all the fun.",
        "stillPath": "/5T66wFcHeyqAewE056gdpdci4sr.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-06",
        "episodeNumber": 7,
        "name": "Episode 7",
        "overview": "Two captives become four, and somehow, Falah’s matchmaking odds only improve. With one tent, two unlikely couples and a scandal up his sleeve, could his biggest opponent end up doing him the biggest favour?",
        "stillPath": "/vaehIcQXLIKp2oXLZGSywaehkA9.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-07",
        "episodeNumber": 8,
        "name": "Episode 8",
        "overview": "Losses officially allocated: one couple per household. Nawal and Falah divide and rule, while the newlyweds master a survival skill of their own: nod, smile… then do exactly as they please.",
        "stillPath": "/sMvXTeUZXXEnm992YzkW0a503O3.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-08",
        "episodeNumber": 9,
        "name": "Episode 9",
        "overview": "Nawal keeps her enemy closer and gets a bonus: Noura’s past, delivered by an old friend with no filter. One “Fahad” later, Noura and Rakan are walking on eggshells, their marriage one wrong word away from falling apart.",
